        "Dropshipping is an ecommerce fulfilment model in which a store sells a product to a customer, while a supplier or fulfilment partner ships the product to that customer. The store operator is responsible for the customer-facing business: product selection, offer, marketing, website, payment experience, customer support, and managing the supplier relationship.",
